                  "respondSec": 45,
                  "script": "Thank you for speaking with me today. I'd like to ask you some questions about hobbies. What kind of hobbies do you or your friends enjoy doing in your free time? For example, do you like playing sports, doing creative activities, playing games, or other types of hobbies?",
